Crucible bounds every buffer it keeps<Quiet>[1]</> and draws nothing a model wrote as an  
escape<Quiet>[2]</>. Press <Code>[Ctrl]</>+<Code>[O]</> to see a cut result; H<Quiet>₂</>O and x<Quiet>²</> read as written.    
                                                                                
<Quiet>Details:</> <Bold>Why the record is bounded</>                                              
  A store that grew with the session would spend the RSS budget.                
                                                                                
<Quiet>[1]</><Quiet> CLAUDE.md, "Everything kept is bounded"</>                                     
<Quiet>[2]</><Quiet> markdown.rs, the rule the reader opens with</>
